 "beats": {
  "w4-unlock": [
   {
    "day": 54,
    "text": "🏃 Victor of Stonebridge walks into Haven unannounced, pack-mules behind. \"Heard your bins are echoing. Stonebridge has grain to spare — 2,016 kcal, no tribute, no ceremony. Say the word.\""
   },
   {
    "day": 54,
    "text": "🌿 Eun-chae checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~16 days of fresh on hand… leaves the fish nets standing and turns to the stone pile instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."
   },
   {
    "day": 54,
    "text": "⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."
   },
   {
    "day": 54,
    "text": "🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the southeast. They carried off ~1600 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 55,
    "text": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Aroha is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
   },
   {
    "day": 55,
    "text": "🌿 Eun-chae checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~17 days of fresh on hand… leaves the fish nets standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."
   },
   {
    "day": 55,
    "text": "⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "The village threw out spoiled stores: Tribute grain from Thornfield, Tribute grain from Stonebridge. Nino mutters: \"Should've smoked that. Fresh stuff keeps a day or two on the shelf — the smoke rack is right there.\" (pantry)"
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "📡 RATINGS ARE UP... Wave 4 talent has been released. The Mirror Draft opens."
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "📺 \"But finales — FINALES need a NATION, sweetheart. Three seasoned bonds under ONE head. Or bend the knee to somebody who already has one. The producers are WAITING.\""
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "📺 RATINGS ARE UP! The producers are pleased. New casting directives incoming — Wave 4 talent has been released into your sector."
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "📺 \"We've been watching you for a LONG time. Your faiths. Your formats. Your little institutions. So we built something out of... well. Out of YOU. Say hello to the MIRROR DRAFT.\""
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Christopher Álvarez is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "🕯️ Christopher is dead — and the dead hold no treaties. Every link Haven has shakes."
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "Thornfield watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 3,000 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "🕯️ Christopher Álvarez is dead — combat. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging."
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "The Codex doesn't pause for grief. Elif blinks — and it's already there, overlaying everything, syncing. No pen. No paper. The mantle just... transfers."
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "🌿 Eun-chae checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~12 days of fresh on hand… leaves the fish nets standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "🌾 Tribute from Emberhold arrives — 4,000 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire."
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "🧳 Word of Haven’s the televised games, new bindings is doing work out there — Word comes late, through traders: The Red Table has bound itself to Thornfield. The region's map is being redrawn — not by Haven."
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Four waves. FOUR. The producers are — okay, I'm saying it: FINALES need a NATION. You've got a region; now make it a REALM. Bind fires under one head, or bend the knee to someone who has. The higher-ups are watching. ...Did I say higher-ups? I said "
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "The table is being set — a lesser seat, priced for what you built. They are watching to see who comes to it."
   },
   {
    "day": 56,
    "text": "⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."
   },
   {
    "day": 57,
    "text": "◈ THE TABLE — it is not a table. It's a ring of pale light, and around it, things with too many angles to be faces. Above it all — the audience. Trillions of eyes, and every one of them knows your name. The System speaks, and for once it isn't performing: \"HUM"
   },
   {
    "day": 57,
    "text": "◈ THE AUDIT — the System reads your run back to you, and the galaxy listens. A lesser seat — regional standing, waves 1–3 faced (14/6/3), 7 contests survived, 3 crises weathered. The table does not rise. It prices."
   },
   {
    "day": 57,
    "text": "🌿 Nadia checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~16 days of fresh on hand… leaves the fish nets standing and turns to the stone pile instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."
   },
   {
    "day": 57,
    "text": "⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."
